th warm beige walls and a soft stainless steel tub edge visible in the distance. Hand grip is natural and does not cover the open case design. Authentic phone camera lighting, realistic depth of field, crisp detail on the product.\n\nAvoid: missing products, extra products, duplicate products, wrong product count, changed colors, wrong logo placement, fake text, distorted labels, incorrect scale, floating products, impossible placement, extra fingers, distorted hands, car salon, luxury spa, vet clinic, white studio background, yellow color cast, CGI, cartoon, 3D render, over-polished ad look.",\012      "scene_type": "product in hand",\012      "angle": "groomer hand-held close-up"\012    },\012    {\012      "position": 5,\012      "title": "PROMPT 5 — Diagonal Flat-Lay Placement on Stainless Steel Table Edge",\012      "prompt_text": "A realistic UGC-style product flat-lay photo, 1:1 aspect ratio, set in a professional pet grooming salon. Shot from a stylish top-down diagonal perspective showing the exact open black earbud charging case and loose earbud from Reference Image 1 placed on a clean grey rubber grooming mat adjacent to a polished stainless steel table rim. The open case shows its glossy internal mold with one black earbud inserted, while the second earbud sits neatly beside it.\n\nBackground: subtle grooming salon workstation setting with muted slate grey background accents, clean table texture, and soft natural salon lighting creating realistic contact shadows beneath the case and earbud. Minimalist, clear, authentic product setup shot.\n\nAvoid: missing products, extra products, duplicate products, wrong product count, changed colors, wrong logo placement, fake text, distorted labels, incorrect scale, floating products, impossible placement, cluttered background, car salon, luxury spa, vet clinic, white studio background, yellow color cast, CGI, cartoon, 3D render, over-polished ad look.",\012      "scene_type": "tabletop flat-lay",\012      "angle": 